extends layout
include mixins

block content
  +heading("We couldn't delete your account yet")
  +greeting(firstName)
  p(style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#000909;")
    | We weren't able to process your account deletion request.
  table(role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#F1F1F1; border-radius:10px; margin:0 0 20px 0;")
    tr
      td(style="padding:16px 20px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#000909;")= reason
  p(style="margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#7F7F7F;")
    | Once that's sorted, you can submit a new request from Settings in the app. Your account stays active in the meantime.
